  <url type="contact">https://converse.linkmauve.fr/touhou@muc.linkmauve.fr</url>

  <description>
    <p>Runs Touhou 6 — Embodiment of Scarlet Devil on Linux, without Wine.</p>

    <p>This requires you to buy the original game, as this engine requires its data to run.</p>
  </description>

