      <description>
        <p>Rewrite the main entrypoint in Rust</p>

        <p>This lets us progressively replace Python modules with Rust ones.</p>

        <p>Currently missing features include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Saving replays</li>
          <li>Networking code for cooperative mode</li>
          <li>Reading a configuration file for options</li>
          <li>Maybe more.</li>
        </ul>

        <p>But the base game is working, so yay!</p>
      </description>
    </release>
